// were unchanged by the rewrite of the window; the window45 entries moved
// because the old window read future days and repeated a month, which
// undercounted absences. The new counts were checked by hand: Thursday and
// Friday 12-13 March, 12-13 February (plus the 16th for attendance-watch,
// 16th to 19th for attendance-at-risk) and the same days in January that
// fall in the latest 45 weekdays, 12 January to 13 March.
